## Overview

Over the last several months, our team has been deeply involved in implementing **Agentforce**, Salesforce’s conversational AI platform. This journey went beyond just setting up prompts — it involved **hands-on experimentation**, **debugging real-world scenarios**, and **adapting architecture** to ensure our agent could handle both business-critical workflows and unexpected edge cases.

